			"source": "<!--\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\nComplete attribution and permission: LICENSE-cc218c56cbae37d52284e1c809c9f1fa1ec7b700ec117ac86a31086fcc2e8df5.txt\nIncluded in the source bundle; notice resource: /licenses/source-notices/cc218c56cbae37d52284e1c809c9f1fa1ec7b700ec117ac86a31086fcc2e8df5.txt\n-->\n<template>\n\t<div aria-label=\"A complete example of page header\">\n\t\t<AsamPageHeader @back=\"onBack\">\n\t\t\t<template #breadcrumb>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumb separator=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem :to=\"{ path: './page-header.html' }\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\thomepage\n\t\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"./page-header.html\">route 1</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem>route 2</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumb>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\t\t\t<template #content>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamAvatar\n\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"mr-3\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t:size=\"32\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsrc=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%22180%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%22180%22%20fill%3D%22%238899aa%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22240%22%20cy%3D%2245%22%20r%3D%2228%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20180L100%2060L220%20180%22%20fill%3D%22%2340566c%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2212%22%20y%3D%2230%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3EASAM%20sample%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"\n\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-large font-600 mr-3\"> Title </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-sm mr-2\" style=\"color: var(--el-text-color-regular)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSub title\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamTag>Default</AsamTag>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\t\t\t<template #extra>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamButton>Print</AsamButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamButton type=\"primary\" class=\"ml-2\">Edit</AsamButton>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\n\t\t\t<AsamDescriptions :column=\"3\" size=\"small\" class=\"mt-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"Username\"> kooriookami </AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"Telephone\"> 18100000000 </AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"Place\">Suzhou</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"Remarks\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamTag size=\"small\">School</AsamTag>\n\t\t\t\t</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"Address\">\n\t\t\t\t\tNo.1188, Wuzhong Avenue, Wuzhong District, Suzhou, Jiangsu Province\n\t\t\t\t</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t</AsamDescriptions>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-4 text-sm\">\n\t\t\t\tASAM UI team uses <b>weekly</b> release strategy under normal circumstance, but\n\t\t\t\tcritical bug fixes would require hotfix so the actual release number\n\t\t\t\t<b>could be</b> more than 1 per week.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</AsamPageHeader>\n\t</div>\n</template>\n\n<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\ndefineOptions({ name: 'AsamPageHeaderCapCompleteDemo' });\nimport {\n\tAsamPageHeader,\n\tAsamBreadcrumb,\n\tAsamBreadcrumbItem,\n\tAsamAvatar,\n\tAsamTag,\n\tAsamButton,\n\tAsamDescriptions,\n\tAsamDescriptionsItem\n} from '@asam-ui/ui';\n\nimport { AsamNotification as notify } from '@asam-ui/ui';\n\nconst onBack = () => {\n\tnotify('Back');\n};\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n/* Local styles keep this sample runnable without a website utility-CSS preset. */\n.flex {\n\tdisplay: flex;\n}\n\n.items-center {\n\talign-items: center;\n}\n\n.mr-3 {\n\tmargin-right: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.text-large {\n\tfont-size: var(--el-font-size-large);\n}\n\n.font-600 {\n\tfont-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.text-sm {\n\tfont-size: var(--el-font-size-small);\n}\n\n.mr-2 {\n\tmargin-right: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.ml-2 {\n\tmargin-left: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.mt-4 {\n\tmargin-top: 1rem;\n}\n</style>\n",
